            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Golden Hotel Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ZuziaBulu\nLondon, United Kingdom35 contributions\n0\nNice buffet breakfast\nJul 2015 • Family\nThere was a great variety of food served for free from 6 am till 9.30 am for the guests of the hotel. The food was generally okay, definitely nothing special. I wish the fried eggs were not so oily . The orange juice was from concentrated but there was inconsistency in how they mix it with water. On the last day of my stay, I found the watermelon rather sour (that was the only day I came down for breakfast really early (6.30 am) because I had to catch an early flight). I suspect it was left over from previous day.\n\nThe staff were attentive. They cleared up all the dishes after us.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 1, 2015",
